  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "都市建築發展與治理",
    "sub_ename": "URBAN ARCHITECTURAL DEVELOPMENT AND GOVERNANCE",
    "describe_ch": "探討當前城市發展的最新趨勢與知識，分析21世紀城市在對應全球社會變遷、經濟發展轉型以及氣候變遷下，所應變之策略與轉型之方法。除了從系統性探討城市發展變遷的脈絡外，更將透過個別城市發展經驗的討論，掌握不同城市在不同文化社會條件下，所展現出當代城市豐富的光譜以及其背後的智慧。",
    "describe_eh": "Explore the latest trends and knowledge of current urban development, analyze the strategies and transition methods of 21st century cities in response to changes in global society, and economic development. In addition to exploring the context of urban development changes, through the discussion of the development experience of cities, we will grasp the rich spectrum of contemporary cities and the wisdom behind them under different social conditions in different cities.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
